error[X0345]: `defer` needs code to run, not a declaration
 --> defer.xn:3:11
  |
3 |     defer var value:int = 1                         // X0345
  |           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this variable would only exist inside the deferred code
  |
help: put the declaration and the code using it in a block: `defer { … }`

error[X0342]: `return` can't leave deferred code
 --> defer.xn:4:11
  |
4 |     defer return                                    // X0342
  |     ----- ^^^^^^ `return` inside `defer`
  |     |
  |     deferred here
  |
  = note: deferred code runs while its block is already ending: it can't return, or break out of a loop around the block

