warning[X0877]: nothing follows this `defer`
 --> defer.xn:7:5
  |
7 |     defer trace('last')                             // X0877
  |     ^^^^^ runs right away
  |
  = note: deferred code runs when its block ends, and the block ends here
help: move the `defer` before the code it should run after, or remove `defer`

error[X0805]: `r` is handed on here, but deferred code still uses it
  --> defer.xn:13:12
   |
12 |     defer r.touch()
   |     ----- runs after the `return`
13 |     return r                                        // X0805
   |            ^ the caller owns it from here
   |
   = note: deferred code runs after `return` has handed the value to the caller, so the variable no longer holds it
